# Line-ending policy: NO CONVERSION, ANYWHERE.
#
# WHY: the native helper build records sourceSha256 = SHA-256 of the RAW bytes of
# lib/core/worker.cs and lib/attention-worker.cs, and scripts/verify-package.mjs checks
# that same raw-byte hash. Any CRLF/LF conversion during checkout changes those bytes
# and therefore breaks the source-to-binary correspondence that the manifests assert.
# -text disables all automatic EOL conversion so a clone is byte-identical to the
# tree the manifests were produced from.
* -text